        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It is just one of those random thoughts that hit me from time to time. I was wondering what are the actual damages that games can cause to us. I've been looking it up and found out that it's not as bad as it seems to be. In some articles, they even mentioned how good it could be for us to play games (like the 5 good reasons why games are good for you on sheeparcade and also another article I found on ign but I could not find the link again later on sorryyyy). I am honestly just looking for reasons to convince my mom that it's all good and there is nothing to worry about XD.</p>",
